## portus.csrf — protección CSRF por doble envío.
##
## El servidor pone una cookie `portus_csrf` (legible por JavaScript) y espera
## que el cliente la repita en la cabecera `X-CSRF-Token` en cada petición que
## cambia estado. `guard` rechaza con 403 las que no coinciden.
##
## ## Memoria
## `token` devuelve un string propio; libéralo con `banish`. `guard` no
## devuelve datos.
import std.scrolls
import std.ward
import portus.context as context_module
import portus.error as error_module
import portus.handler as handler_module
import portus.native as native_module
import portus.text as text

## Cabecera esperada.
const HEADER_NAME as string is "X-CSRF-Token"

## Cookie donde vive el token.
const COOKIE_NAME as string is "portus_csrf"

## Compara en tiempo constante.
weave _same with a as string, b as string into bool:
    if (calling scrolls.len with a) != (calling scrolls.len with b):
        return false
    var code as int is calling native_module.portus_native_constant_time_eq with (bytes of a), (calling scrolls.len with a), (bytes of b), (calling scrolls.len with b)
    return code == 1

## Token de la petición: reutiliza la cookie o crea una nueva.
##
## ## Memoria
## Devuelve un string propio; libéralo con `banish`.
weave token with context as ref to context_module.Context into string:
    let existing as maybe string is calling context.cookie with COOKIE_NAME
    if existing.is_present:
        return calling text.copy with existing.value
    var fresh as string is calling text.from_cstr with (calling native_module.portus_native_request_id)
    var owned as string is calling text.copy with fresh
    banish fresh
    calling context.set_cookie with COOKIE_NAME, owned
    return owned

## `true` si la cabecera y la cookie coinciden.
weave check with context as ref to context_module.Context into bool:
    let cookie as maybe string is calling context.cookie with COOKIE_NAME
    if not cookie.is_present:
        return false
    let header as maybe string is calling context.header with "x-csrf-token"
    if not header.is_present:
        return false
    return calling _same with cookie.value, header.value

## Rechaza (403) las peticiones que cambian estado sin token válido.
weave guard with context as ref to context_module.Context into result of void to error_module.HttpError:
    var method as string is calling context.method
    defer banish method
    if method == "GET" or method == "HEAD" or method == "OPTIONS":
        return calling handler_module.ok_void
    if calling check with context:
        return calling handler_module.ok_void
    calling context.set_status with 403
    var body as string is "csrf token invalido"
    defer banish body
    calling context.send_text with body
    calling context.mark_sent
    return calling handler_module.ok_void

test "compara tokens":
    calling ward.assert_true with (calling _same with "abc", "abc")
    calling ward.assert_false with (calling _same with "abc", "abd")
